        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{11}{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3\\frac{2}{3}&=\\frac{3\\times3+2}{3}\\\\3\\frac{2}{3}&=\\frac{11}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nThe numerator and denominator are integers and the denominator is nonzero, so the number is rational.",
