          "short": "$\\frac{4}{9}$",
          "worked": "Let $S=0.\\dot{4}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10S&=4.444\\ldots\\\\10S&=4+S\\\\9S&=4\\\\S&=\\frac{4}{9}\\end{align*}$$\nThe numerator and denominator are integers and the denominator is nonzero, so the number is rational.",
